%% Deploy Friday by emphonic.com
%% Why we never deploy on Fridays... but always do

sequenceDiagram
    participant Dev as Developer 
    participant Git as Git
    participant CI as CI/CD Pipeline
    participant Prod as Production 
    participant PagerDuty as PagerDuty
    participant Weekend as Weekend Plans 

    Note over Dev,Weekend: Friday 4:30 PM

    Dev->>Git: git push --force (it's just a small fix)
    Git->>CI: Trigger build
    CI-->>Dev: All tests pass!
    Dev->>Prod: Deploy to production

    Note over Prod: 4:45 PM - Everything looks fine

    Dev->>Weekend: Time to relax!
    Weekend-->>Dev: Pizza ordered

    Note over Prod: 5:01 PM - Database connection pool exhausted

    Prod->>PagerDuty: CRITICAL ALERT
    PagerDuty->>Dev: Wake up! Prod is down!
    Dev->>Weekend: Cancel everything
    Weekend--xDev: Pizza gets cold

    Dev->>Prod: SSH into server
    Prod-->>Dev: Permission denied
    Dev->>Dev: Where's the VPN?

    Note over Dev,Prod: 11:47 PM - Finally fixed

    Dev->>Git: Revert all changes
    Dev->>Dev: Never again deploy on Friday

    Note over Dev: Next Friday 4:30 PM

    Dev->>Git: git push (it's REALLY just a tiny fix this time)
